asr-000030
00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:06.920
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The gentleman of the 1st District of Surigao del Sur,

asr-000031
00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:10.920
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Vice Chair Romeo S. Momo, Sr.

asr-000032
00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.920
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: As sponsor, you are recognized, sir. Please proceed.

asr-000033
00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000034
00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague,

asr-000035
00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:26.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: the proposed 2027 budget of the Department of Public Works and Highways,

asr-000036
00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:32.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: is in the amount of 643.95 billion,

asr-000037
00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:40.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: with the lowest flood control budget since 2019 in the amount of 83.84 billion.

asr-000038
00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:48.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: A year ago, our nation learned that the people's money meant to hold back floodwaters

asr-000039
00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:55.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: was stolen through ghost flood control projects as well as substandard.

asr-000040
00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:59.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: We heard testimony of cash delivered in luggages.

asr-000041
00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:06.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Our people waded through the same flood while the funds meant to protect them disappeared.

asr-000042
00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:13.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: No sponsor of this budget can stand here and pretend otherwise.

asr-000043
00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:20.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The question before us is not whether the Department of Public Works and Highways deserves our trust.

asr-000044
00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: It is whether this budget is built so that,

asr-000045
00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:27.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: so that blind trust is no longer needed,

asr-000046
00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:34.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: so that every peso from each and every Juan and Juana can be checked.

asr-000047
00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: This budget is different in four ways.

asr-000048
00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: First, accountability.

asr-000049
00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: We heard the anger.

asr-000050
00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Alam natin na galit ang tao.

asr-000051
00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: After the 2025 Ghost Flood Control Project scandal,

asr-000052
00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: our beloved President,

asr-000053
00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:55.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Bongbong Marcos,

asr-000054
00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:59.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and this Congress demanded reforms.

asr-000055
00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:01.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: For 2027,

asr-000056
00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:08.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: the Department of Public Works and Highways scrapped the old parametric formula

asr-000057
00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:13.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and the practice where projects could enter the national expenditure program

asr-000058
00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:17.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: with just a little title and cost.

asr-000059
00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:19.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Today,

asr-000060
00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: through Secretary Vince Dixon,

asr-000061
00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:29.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: no projects enters NEP without the four non-negotiable requirements.

asr-000062
00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:32.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Number one is the approved program of work.

asr-000063
00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:39.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Number two, on-site validated geotag photos.

asr-000064
00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:48.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Number four, budget preparation documents such as the BP2O2 form that passes through PDC,

asr-000065
00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: or Provincial Development Council,

asr-000066
00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: RDC, or the Regional Development Council,

asr-000067
00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:56.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: supported with resolutions.

asr-000068
00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Signed Certificate of Implementability.

asr-000069
00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Every project will be monitored via DBM Compass

asr-000070
00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and the DPWH Transparency Portal

asr-000071
00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:13.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: with before, during, and after photos.

asr-000072
00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: As of September 23, 2026,

asr-000073
00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: the Department has blacklisted

asr-000074
00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: nine contractors

asr-000075
00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and is pursuing more than 80 administrative cases.

asr-000076
00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Second,

asr-000077
00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:31.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: flood management projects return

asr-000078
00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: with discipline.

asr-000079
00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: DPWH's

asr-000080
00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:38.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: 83.84 billion flood program

asr-000081
00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:42.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: prioritizes finishing unfinished structures,

asr-000082
00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: closing the gaps,

asr-000083
00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: repairing pumping stations,

asr-000084
00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: drainage and floodgates,

asr-000085
00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: guided by river basin

asr-000086
00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and drainage master plans,

asr-000087
00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: such as those in Quezon City,

asr-000088
00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:56.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Metro Manila,

asr-000089
00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:57.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Metro Cebu,

asr-000090
00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:58.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Iligan,

asr-000091
00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and other places in the country.

asr-000092
00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: It continues foreign assisted projects

asr-000093
00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: like the Pasig-Marikina Channel Improvement.

asr-000094
00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:10.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Third, equity and resilience.

asr-000095
00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Where the money goes.

asr-000096
00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:15.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000097
00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:18.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: of the 643.95 billion,

asr-000098
00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:47.940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: P199.58 billion is for OO1, or Organizational Outcome 1, under the capital outlay operation, covering the principal mandates of the Department of Public Works and Highways: construction and maintenance of national roads, bridges, and other related infrastructure.

asr-000099
00:07:48.920 --> 00:08:04.260
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: P83.84 billion is for OO2, or Organizational Outcome 2, under capital outlay operation, covering flood control, seawalls, and other related infrastructure.

asr-000100
00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:18.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: P117.74 billion is for Foreign Assisted Projects, covering national roads, bridges, flood mitigation, and national building program.

asr-000101
00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:24.660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: We have per-district breakdown for every district engineering offices.

asr-000102
00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:30.800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Fourth, it begins correcting a decade imbalance.

asr-000103
00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:48.660
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: For 10 years, Luzon averaged 56% of allocation, but in 2027, Luzon's share falls to 52.62%, and the Visayas and Mindanao together rise to about

asr-000104
00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: 47%.

asr-000105
00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:59.880
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In short, the Department of Public Works budget is not to build more, but to build better.

asr-000106
00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:04.020
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Build accountable and build resilient budget.

asr-000107
00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:10.560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And on this account, I request the support of this honorable House of the People.

asr-000108
00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:17.460
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, and this representation will now be honored to answer the questions of our dear colleague.

