Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos yung iba,

asr-000378
00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:36.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: lalagyan pa ng prescriptive period.

asr-000379
00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:39.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bunuti ninyo within a period of five days.

asr-000380
00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, masama po iyon.

asr-000381
00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:47.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, we are talking of already energized line.

asr-000382
00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pag ginalaw mo yan,

asr-000383
00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: burn out yung napakalaki.

asr-000384
00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:52.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Apektado yung economy ng lugar na yan.

asr-000385
00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:58.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya nga, mayroon tayong joint circular 1, 2, 3

asr-000386
00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:01.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: para maayos yung mga ganyan.

asr-000387
00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:05.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alam namin, one year pa na may tatamaan.

asr-000388
00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:08.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi poste yung binibili natin.

asr-000389
00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Poste at saka conductor.

asr-000390
00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:14.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi yun isda sa palingke.

asr-000391
00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:16.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Na pagpunta mo, bayad ka,

asr-000392
00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: magtimbang, nandiyan na.

asr-000393
00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:21.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Poste yun, ibiding pa, etc.

asr-000394
00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, maasahan ko ba ang DPWH,

asr-000395
00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-000396
00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:30.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ito ay paulit-ulit.

asr-000397
00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maasahan ko ba na,

asr-000398
00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:36.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: this is the last budget year na pag-usapan natin ito.

asr-000399
00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:39.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, ang Judiciary,

asr-000400
00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:43.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang Department of National Defense,

asr-000401
00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: PNP, lahat,

asr-000402
00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: two years, three years,

asr-000403
00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:50.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang issue ko, sinisingil ko kasi hindi sila nagbabayad.

asr-000404
00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ngayon, nawala na.

asr-000405
00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nawala na.

asr-000406
00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:56.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, nagbabayad na sila sa mga kampo nila,

asr-000407
00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nagbabayad na sa mga RTC,

asr-000408
00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:03.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mga DPWH issue na lang ang hanggang ngayon nandito pa.

asr-000409
00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kayo na lang yung last agency na...

asr-000410
00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:11.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, I don't want to take this issue again.

asr-000411
00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:15.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Next year, kung buhay pa ako, uulitin ko ito.

asr-000412
00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:17.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-000413
00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, Your Honor,

asr-000414
00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:24.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: una, pasalamat tayo na si Secretary Benz ang ating sekretary.

asr-000415
00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil, for the first time,

asr-000416
00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:30.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: ngayon lang nangyari na may 650 million allocation

asr-000417
00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:34.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: para sa ating pambayad ng electric poles.

asr-000418
00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:37.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In fact,

asr-000419
00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:40.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: nagre-request din si Department of Public Works and Highways

asr-000420
00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:44.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: na kung madagdagan ang budget nila for the relocation of poles,

asr-000421
00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:47.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: welcome na ma-welcome nila yun.

asr-000422
00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, 650 for this 2027,

asr-000423
00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:54.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and hopefully, there will be an addition to this

asr-000424
00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:58.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: para at least makover na natin yung gap na 4 point something billion.

asr-000425
00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:01.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Pangalawa,

asr-000426
00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Secretary welcomes the move

asr-000427
00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:09.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: that there will be a joint meeting and probably to trace out problems

asr-000428
00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:14.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: between the regional office and the cooperatives, one in each region.

asr-000429
00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:15.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So that,

asr-000430
00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:19.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: in identifying the electric poles affected

asr-000431
00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:22.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: of the projects to be implemented

asr-000432
00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: by DPWH,

asr-000433
00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:25.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: ma-identify na nila yun

asr-000434
00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:29.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: at para mabigyan na kaagad ng kaukulang program of work ng NEA.

asr-000435
00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:32.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Then, pangatlo,

asr-000436
00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:36.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: yung tungkol sa local roads na maafiktuhan,

asr-000437
00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:40.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: unfortunately, it is not within their mandate.

asr-000438
00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:44.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, they are requesting that, probably, special probation in our GAA,

asr-000439
00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:46.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: be included,

asr-000440
00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:49.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: that even local roads affected

asr-000441
00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:53.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: by the transfer in the widening,

asr-000442
00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:57.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: be also be afforded,

asr-000443
00:21:57.600 --> 00:22:01.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: afforded with the same amount na kailangan nila

asr-000444
00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:03.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: in the relocation of their poles.

asr-000445
00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:06.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I understand, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-000446
00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:08.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Speaker,

asr-000447
00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:10.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sa mga local roads.

asr-000448
00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: However,

asr-000449
00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: the local government units

asr-000450
00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:17.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: are always seeking assistance

asr-000451
00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:20.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa mga district engineering natin

asr-000452
00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:23.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa survey, etc., etc.

asr-000453
00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:26.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, I raise this issue

asr-000454
00:22:26.600 --> 00:22:31.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi para ma-alarma yung mga district engineering office natin

asr-000455
00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:35.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na kung mag-request si Mayor ng assistance,

asr-000456
00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:38.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ay survey muna ninyo kasi mag-ano kami ng Barangay Road,

asr-000457
00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:42.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: iwasan na nila yung mga ano na yun

asr-000458
00:22:42.600 --> 00:22:49.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi under the provision of Republic Act 10531,

asr-000459
00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:52.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang implementing agency ang magbayad.

asr-000460
00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:55.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: In this case, it is the local government unit.

asr-000461
00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:58.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Di problema na naman tayo kasi nandyan yung kalsada

asr-000462
00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:00.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na sa gitna yung pusti.

asr-000463
00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:05.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit kasi ano talaga yung kalsada doon sa pusti

asr-000464
00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:07.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na nandyan na yung pusti?

asr-000465
00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:10.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yun ang hindi ko maintindihan.

asr-000466
00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:14.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Secretary, I am a line man for nine years.

asr-000467
00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:17.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, kaya alam ko yung mga ganyan.

asr-000468
00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:24.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I hope na we will realize

asr-000469
00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:29.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: our discussion and agreement

asr-000470
00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:31.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na magkaroon talaga ng

asr-000471
00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:33.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: information education campaign

asr-000472
00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:38.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: para pari-pariho po yung interpretation natin sa joint circular,

asr-000473
00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:39.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pari-pariho po,

asr-000474
00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:44.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung interpretation natin sa pagbayad,

asr-000475
00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:45.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: anong bayaran,

asr-000476
00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:48.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ano lang ang dapat gawin

asr-000477
00:23:48.600 --> 00:23:51.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sa preparation ng program of work.

asr-000478
00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:55.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Can I, for the second time,

asr-000479
00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:57.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: second time kay SecBins,

asr-000480
00:23:57.600 --> 00:24:03.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pero ito, for the fourth time na ito sa sponsor,

asr-000481
00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:06.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: for the second time, Secretary Bins,

asr-000482
00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi naman po siguro malaking gastos kung

asr-000483
00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:10.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: magme-meeting tayo.

asr-000484
00:24:10.600 --> 00:24:12.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: For example, Siarilco.

asr-000485
00:24:12.600 --> 00:24:15.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Siarilco can host that meeting, no?

asr-000486
00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:19.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: For, halimbawa, region, Sakaraga region, no?

asr-000487
00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:22.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ANICO, Agosa Norte Electric Cooperative,

asr-000488
00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:26.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: which is a holding office in Butuan City,

asr-000489
00:24:26.600 --> 00:24:27.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: can host that meeting.

asr-000490
00:24:27.600 --> 00:24:29.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: We can host that meeting.

asr-000491
00:24:29.600 --> 00:24:31.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Walang gasto ang DPWH.

asr-000492
00:24:31.600 --> 00:24:38.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Para lang, para lang magka-reconcile yung ating pag-intindi

asr-000493
00:24:38.600 --> 00:24:39.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa Section 16,

asr-000494
00:24:40.600 --> 00:24:42.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ng Republic Act 10531,

asr-000495
00:24:42.600 --> 00:24:46.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at GMC 1, 2, 3, and 4.

asr-000496
00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:50.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Biruin mo, umamot na tayo sa Joint Memorandum Circular 4,

asr-000497
00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:52.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi pa rin tayo nagkaintindihan.

asr-000498
00:24:52.600 --> 00:24:59.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yeah, thank you, honorable speaker and my colleague.

asr-000499
00:24:59.600 --> 00:25:04.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In fact, we are lucky because Secretary increases

asr-000500
00:25:04.600 --> 00:25:09.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: the budget for the relocation of poles.

asr-000501
00:25:09.600 --> 00:25:11.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: But, not only that,

asr-000502
00:25:11.600 --> 00:25:13.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: he welcomes additional, no?

asr-000503
00:25:13.600 --> 00:25:15.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung sana madagdagan natin, no?

asr-000504
00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:17.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Pero pangalawa, sabi niya,

asr-000505
00:25:17.600 --> 00:25:20.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: he is about to issue a memorandum directing all regional directors

asr-000506
00:25:20.600 --> 00:25:25.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: to have a meeting with all the managers of the cooperative

asr-000507
00:25:25.600 --> 00:25:27.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: so that they can come up with,

asr-000508
00:25:27.600 --> 00:25:30.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: with, siguro, meeting of minds

asr-000509
00:25:30.600 --> 00:25:35.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: about, on how to interpret the memorandum.

asr-000510
00:25:35.600 --> 00:25:37.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Then third, he is willing to go to,

asr-000511
00:25:37.600 --> 00:25:40.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Butuan,

asr-000512
00:25:40.600 --> 00:25:42.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: just to attend the meeting with

asr-000513
00:25:42.600 --> 00:25:44.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: the regional director

asr-000514
00:25:44.600 --> 00:25:46.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: as well as the cooperative managers

asr-000515
00:25:46.600 --> 00:25:49.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: in that particular region.

asr-000516
00:25:49.600 --> 00:25:51.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Distinguished sponsor,

asr-000517
00:25:51.600 --> 00:25:53.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: salamat po, pero

asr-000518
00:25:53.600 --> 00:25:58.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I am only stating, no?

asr-000519
00:25:58.600 --> 00:26:00.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Butuan as an example,

asr-000520
00:26:00.600 --> 00:26:01.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: in Caraga,

asr-000521
00:26:01.600 --> 00:26:03.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: what I mean is,

asr-000522
00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:05.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: in the whole country,

asr-000523
00:26:05.600 --> 00:26:07.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: the electric cooperative,

asr-000524
00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:08.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: no,

asr-000525
00:26:08.600 --> 00:26:11.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: can meet DPWH officials

asr-000526
00:26:11.600 --> 00:26:13.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: on a regional basis

asr-000527
00:26:13.600 --> 00:26:16.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: and the electric cooperative can host

asr-000528
00:26:16.600 --> 00:26:18.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: that meeting

asr-000529
00:26:18.600 --> 00:26:20.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: without cost sa DP

asr-000530
00:26:20.600 --> 00:26:23.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: para lang magkatugma yung ating intindi

asr-000531
00:26:23.600 --> 00:26:25.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi ang regional director,

asr-000532
00:26:25.600 --> 00:26:28.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: iba ang kanyang intindi

asr-000533
00:26:28.600 --> 00:26:30.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: interpretation sa batas.

asr-000534
00:26:30.600 --> 00:26:32.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Iba din ang district engineer.

asr-000535
00:26:32.600 --> 00:26:34.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay na si district engineer, pero

asr-000536
00:26:34.600 --> 00:26:36.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pag tinanong mo, bakit hindi pa rin nabayaran?

asr-000537
00:26:36.600 --> 00:26:38.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit hindi pa rin nabayaran to?

asr-000538
00:26:38.600 --> 00:26:40.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Matagal na namin na-comply tong requirements.

asr-000539
00:26:40.600 --> 00:26:42.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ano kasi si regional director?

asr-000540
00:26:42.600 --> 00:26:46.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Minsan din, okay yung regional director,

asr-000541
00:26:46.600 --> 00:26:50.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi din magkatugma sa interpretation ni DE.

asr-000542
00:26:50.600 --> 00:26:53.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Susunod si DE, pero hindi susunod yung contractor.

asr-000543
00:26:53.600 --> 00:26:55.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sasabihin ni contractor.

asr-000544
00:26:55.600 --> 00:26:58.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, kaya the purpose of that meeting,

asr-000545
00:26:58.600 --> 00:27:03.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: para ma-reconcile yung ating pag-unawa doon sa

asr-000546
00:27:03.600 --> 00:27:05.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Section 16G,

asr-000547
00:27:05.600 --> 00:27:11.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pinanggalingan ng GMC 1234.

asr-000548
00:27:11.600 --> 00:27:13.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, salamat doon sa ano.

asr-000549
00:27:13.600 --> 00:27:17.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Actually, ang katanungan ko ay

asr-000550
00:27:17.600 --> 00:27:19.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: napaka-kapal.

asr-000551
00:27:19.600 --> 00:27:21.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nag-research ako.

asr-000552
00:27:21.600 --> 00:27:24.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya lang, ito, ang pinaka-importante ko yan.

asr-000553
00:27:24.600 --> 00:27:29.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, I hope, one,

asr-000554
00:27:29.600 --> 00:27:34.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: madagdagan yung budget kasi 4.9 billion na.

asr-000555
00:27:35.600 --> 00:27:38.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pangalawa, I hope, ma-realize na yung,

