00:53:43.080 --> 00:53:51.580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, of course. Lahat naman ho ng member ng Congress can attend. However, there are only few selected members of the Barsi, of course.

asr-000924
00:53:52.000 --> 00:53:57.700
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: That will take, during the deliberation, probably they are the one that can attend.

asr-000925
00:53:57.900 --> 00:54:02.940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Vote on matters that is subject to votation.

asr-000926
00:54:03.280 --> 00:54:10.480
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Hindi, tama po. So, sa subcommittee po, ang member lang po ang pwedeng bumoto. Tama po. Agree po tayo doon.

asr-000927
00:54:11.080 --> 00:54:19.380
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang question po is, sa ibang mga committee, sa lahat ng committee, ang hindi po member ay pwede magtanong, hindi lang pwede bumoto.

asr-000928
00:54:19.380 --> 00:54:27.880
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, ang ibig sabihin po ba noon, sa Barsi, ang hindi member ay pwede pumunta, pwede magtanong, hindi lang rin pwede bumoto.

asr-000929
00:54:27.900 --> 00:54:28.440
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Tama po ba?

asr-000930
00:54:29.240 --> 00:54:32.840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Tama yun, Your Honor, Mr. Speaker, because that is our rule, actually.

asr-000931
00:54:33.260 --> 00:54:36.080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Our rule says that even, hindi ba?

asr-000932
00:54:39.040 --> 00:54:43.900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yeah, only Barsi members, but during the deliberation...

asr-000933
00:54:44.700 --> 00:54:52.900
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Mr. Speaker, why is there a different treatment of the subcommittee of the Committee on Appropriations, which is the BARC,

asr-000934
00:54:52.900 --> 00:54:56.840
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: from the other subcommittees?

asr-000935
00:54:57.900 --> 00:54:59.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Of the House.

asr-000936
00:54:59.620 --> 00:55:02.500
