asr-000977
01:00:00.270 --> 01:00:03.420
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: pwedeng mag-attend sa BARC,

asr-000978
01:00:03.800 --> 01:00:10.740
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: every party has been requested to send a representative.

asr-000979
01:00:10.740 --> 01:00:15.960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, bawat party po, kumuha tayo ng tatlo na member nila

asr-000980
01:00:15.960 --> 01:00:18.940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: para magiging member natin sa BARC.

asr-000981
01:00:19.520 --> 01:00:22.040
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kasamahan nila na magiging member sa BARC.

asr-000982
01:00:22.660 --> 01:00:28.860
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Now, BARC is more focused on institutional amendments.

asr-000983
01:00:28.860 --> 01:00:36.640
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil institutional amendments ito, that means anything that an agency wanted to be included

asr-000984
01:00:36.640 --> 01:00:43.480
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: or to be requesting additional budget, probably,

asr-000985
01:00:44.220 --> 01:00:49.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: could send the request through the BARC and deliberated by the BARC.

asr-000986
01:00:49.160 --> 01:00:53.800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Now, with regards to amendments, actually,

asr-000987
01:00:54.540 --> 01:00:58.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: lahat naman ay pwedeng mag-request.

asr-000988
01:00:58.860 --> 01:01:02.820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Pag-present nito, di ba, ng amendments during the third and final reading,

asr-000989
01:01:03.300 --> 01:01:04.340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: during the period of amendments.

asr-000990
01:01:04.880 --> 01:01:14.620
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I don't think, Your Honor, Mr. Speaker, that's the reason why na hindi lahat maka-attend

asr-000991
01:01:14.620 --> 01:01:17.520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: dahil jury represented naman ang bawat party.

asr-000992
01:01:18.660 --> 01:01:24.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: By the three representatives that we have submitted or they are assigned to attend on the BARC.

asr-000993
01:01:24.460 --> 01:01:27.040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes, Mr. Speaker, naintindihan ko po yun.

asr-000994
01:01:27.040 --> 01:01:28.840
