asr-000995
01:01:28.860 --> 01:01:32.480
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: lahat naman ang subcommittee, pwede ako mag-attend.

asr-000996
01:01:33.300 --> 01:01:35.840
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero dito, bakit hindi ko pwede mag-attend?

asr-000997
01:01:35.940 --> 01:01:36.680
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Attend lang eh.

asr-000998
01:01:36.880 --> 01:01:37.840
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Hindi naman pwede bumoto.

asr-000999
01:01:38.240 --> 01:01:40.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: But I will not argue with that.

asr-001000
01:01:40.440 --> 01:01:46.440
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: If that is the ruling, I will just put on record na I do not agree with that ruling

asr-001001
01:01:46.440 --> 01:01:51.800
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: because every member has a right to attend any committee hearing,

asr-001002
01:01:52.300 --> 01:01:53.500
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: any subcommittee hearing.

asr-001003
01:01:53.740 --> 01:01:54.960
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: The BARC is a subcommittee.

asr-001004
01:01:55.480 --> 01:01:57.600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Therefore, any member has the right to attend.

asr-001005
01:01:57.600 --> 01:01:58.140
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: No?

asr-001006
01:01:58.860 --> 01:02:00.620
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pag-attend, eh hindi pa pwede.

asr-001007
01:02:01.100 --> 01:02:06.500
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: I put on record, I do not agree that is against the principle of transparency.

asr-001008
01:02:06.820 --> 01:02:06.960
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Okay.

asr-001009
01:02:07.700 --> 01:02:17.140
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, babalik tayo doon sa unang-una na kailangan po i-publish sa website ng House

