asr-001011
01:02:22.340 --> 01:02:22.660
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yun po.

asr-001012
01:02:23.120 --> 01:02:24.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kailan po yun gagawin?

asr-001013
01:02:24.360 --> 01:02:26.040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Dahil last year ko po yan rinequest.

asr-001014
01:02:28.860 --> 01:02:33.420
