asr-001018
01:02:53.780 --> 01:02:58.400
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: yung nirequest ng ating kagalanggalang na congressman.

asr-001019
01:02:58.860 --> 01:03:06.080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, therefore, there's no need for Congress to publish because they themselves will publish it in their website.

asr-001020
