Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Dahil,

asr-002950
03:10:33.060 --> 03:10:35.600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: pang limang taon na po natin

asr-002951
03:10:35.600 --> 03:10:37.960
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: pinag-dediscuss

asr-002952
03:10:37.960 --> 03:10:39.600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: itong tulay,

asr-002953
03:10:40.440 --> 03:10:40.740
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang

asr-002954
