asr-003139
03:20:01.480 --> 03:20:03.700
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: And Sorsogon-Samar Bridge Link

asr-003140
03:20:03.700 --> 03:20:08.680
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: is projected to have 42% economic rate of return,

asr-003141
03:20:09.360 --> 03:20:12.320
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na sinabi din ng ating sekretary nung budget briefing.

asr-003142
03:20:12.320 --> 03:20:17.220
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At talagang moving forward,

asr-003143
03:20:17.520 --> 03:20:21.780
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: napakalaking bagay po ito sa ating bansa.

asr-003144
03:20:22.640 --> 03:20:25.860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At ipagpatuloy po natin ito

asr-003145
03:20:25.860 --> 03:20:28.840
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: dahil gusto kong i-input sa inyo

asr-003146
03:20:28.840 --> 03:20:30.960
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na pag nagawa natin ito,

asr-003147
03:20:31.060 --> 03:20:33.020
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: hindi lang tayo nag-aayos sa mga nagdaan,

asr-003148
03:20:33.620 --> 03:20:36.120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: pero ang importante, tumitingin tayo sa future.

asr-003149
03:20:37.740 --> 03:20:41.680
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Our people are expecting too much from us.

asr-003150
03:20:42.540 --> 03:20:46.420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Nasa mga nalalabing taon ng ating Pangulo,

asr-003151
03:20:46.920 --> 03:20:49.140
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: sana magawa natin yung basic foundations

asr-003152
03:20:49.140 --> 03:20:51.640
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na pwede pa natin mag-aayos.

asr-003153
03:20:52.640 --> 03:20:52.960
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Magawa.

asr-003154
03:20:54.380 --> 03:20:57.860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Alam nyo may tatlong bridges pa tayo na napaka-importante.

asr-003155
03:20:58.940 --> 03:21:00.540
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At tama po bang sabihin,

asr-003156
03:21:00.720 --> 03:21:04.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang Asian Development Bank at ang ibang international funders

asr-003157
03:21:04.400 --> 03:21:06.500
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: gustong tumulong sa ating bansa?

asr-003158
03:21:06.720 --> 03:21:07.260
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Tama po ba?

asr-003159
03:21:08.200 --> 03:21:08.760
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Tama po.

asr-003160
03:21:08.940 --> 03:21:10.140
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Speaker, Your Honor,

asr-003161
03:21:10.460 --> 03:21:11.860
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: willing silang tumulong sa atin.

asr-003162
03:21:12.460 --> 03:21:15.280
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pag mataas ang economic rate of return,

asr-003163
03:21:15.680 --> 03:21:18.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: tama po na hindi tayo mawawalaan

asr-003164
03:21:18.400 --> 03:21:21.980
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ng gustong tumulong sa atin at na magpundo.

asr-003165
03:21:22.640 --> 03:21:24.420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang mga mega-infrastructure?

asr-003166
03:21:24.660 --> 03:21:25.340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Tama din po.

asr-003167
03:21:25.780 --> 03:21:29.440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mataas din ang economic rate of return.

asr-003168
03:21:30.240 --> 03:21:32.040
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At kaya nilang counterpart

asr-003169
03:21:32.040 --> 03:21:37.860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang paggawa ng mga feasibility studies?

asr-003170
03:21:38.560 --> 03:21:38.940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes.

asr-003171
03:21:39.460 --> 03:21:41.500
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, ang lahat ng mga funding banks

asr-003172
03:21:41.500 --> 03:21:45.300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: willing magbigay.

asr-003173
03:21:45.300 --> 03:21:46.240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In fact, ang iba nga,

asr-003174
03:21:47.580 --> 03:21:50.300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: hindi na loan kung hindi...

asr-003175
03:21:52.640 --> 03:21:54.540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ang iba nga, grant na.

asr-003176
03:21:54.900 --> 03:21:57.300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So, yung masyadong interesado sila

asr-003177
03:21:57.300 --> 03:21:59.080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: dahil mataas ang economic rate of return,

asr-003178
03:21:59.660 --> 03:22:00.220
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: yung iba nga,

asr-003179
03:22:00.500 --> 03:22:03.000
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: mag-grant na nila yung kanilang share

asr-003180
03:22:03.000 --> 03:22:05.020
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: sa feasibility study.

asr-003181
03:22:05.820 --> 03:22:07.660
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kung nagagawa natin,

asr-003182
03:22:08.060 --> 03:22:10.520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: mag-appropriate ng P130 million

asr-003183
03:22:10.520 --> 03:22:13.420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: para sa paggawa ng feasibility study

asr-003184
03:22:13.420 --> 03:22:16.720
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at ang funder ay nagbibigay ng counterpart.

asr-003185
03:22:17.380 --> 03:22:21.420
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Katulad din po ng Surigao Southern Lighting Bridge

asr-003186
03:22:21.420 --> 03:22:22.620
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na nag-appropriate tayo.

asr-003187
03:22:22.620 --> 03:22:26.320
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mag-appropriate tayo ng P350 million

asr-003188
03:22:26.320 --> 03:22:28.500
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at kaya nilang magbigay ng counterpart.

asr-003189
03:22:29.060 --> 03:22:29.660
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ibig sabihin,

asr-003190
03:22:30.480 --> 03:22:33.700
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: kung gagawa tayo ng three additional bridges

asr-003191
03:22:33.700 --> 03:22:36.340
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at ilagay po natin ito sa ating GAA

asr-003192
03:22:36.340 --> 03:22:38.740
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: for 2028,

asr-003193
03:22:39.000 --> 03:22:40.520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: hindi na ngayong 2027,

asr-003194
03:22:41.220 --> 03:22:43.200
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: aabot lang tayo on the average

asr-003195
03:22:43.200 --> 03:22:47.620
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: P1.050 billion sa tatlong bridges.

asr-003196
03:22:47.800 --> 03:22:50.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pero mas maiksipa ito.

asr-003197
03:22:50.060 --> 03:22:54.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Anong mga tulay

asr-003198
03:22:54.060 --> 03:22:58.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang gusto kong i-propose sa inyo?

asr-003199
03:22:58.060 --> 03:23:00.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Alam niyo,

asr-003200
03:23:00.060 --> 03:23:02.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: kung gagawin natin itong dalawang tulay,

asr-003201
03:23:02.060 --> 03:23:06.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ay may napaka-importanting tulay rin po.

asr-003202
03:23:06.060 --> 03:23:08.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang Leyte-Bujol.

asr-003203
03:23:08.060 --> 03:23:10.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang Leyte-Bujol Bridge

asr-003204
03:23:10.060 --> 03:23:12.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na manggagaling sa

asr-003205
03:23:12.060 --> 03:23:14.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maasin-Southern Leyte

asr-003206
03:23:14.060 --> 03:23:16.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: to Lapinig Island-Bujol

asr-003207
03:23:16.060 --> 03:23:18.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: to Ubay-Bujol

asr-003208
03:23:18.060 --> 03:23:19.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: approximately,

asr-003209
03:23:19.060 --> 03:23:21.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 20 kilometers lang po ito.

asr-003210
03:23:21.060 --> 03:23:22.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At sana po,

asr-003211
03:23:22.060 --> 03:23:26.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: yung mga planners natin isama na rin po ninyo ito.

asr-003212
03:23:26.060 --> 03:23:28.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kasi walang mawawala sa atin

asr-003213
03:23:28.060 --> 03:23:30.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: kung gagawa tayo ng feasibility study.

asr-003214
03:23:30.060 --> 03:23:31.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kasi kung nandyan na,

asr-003215
03:23:31.060 --> 03:23:33.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: dadamputin na lang natin yan.

asr-003216
03:23:33.060 --> 03:23:35.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maglalagay tayo ng pundo.

asr-003217
03:23:35.060 --> 03:23:38.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang Buhol to Cebu Bridge.

asr-003218
03:23:40.060 --> 03:23:43.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mula sa Getafe-Bujol

asr-003219
03:23:43.060 --> 03:23:45.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: to Cordoba-Cebu.

asr-003220
03:23:45.060 --> 03:23:47.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Approximately,

asr-003221
03:23:47.060 --> 03:23:49.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 18 kilometers lang po ito.

asr-003222
03:23:49.060 --> 03:23:52.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang Cebu

asr-003223
03:23:52.060 --> 03:23:54.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: to Santander

asr-003224
03:23:54.060 --> 03:23:57.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: to Negros Island.

asr-003225
03:23:57.060 --> 03:23:59.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Santander-Cebu.

asr-003226
03:23:59.060 --> 03:24:02.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: To Cebulan-Negros Oriental.

asr-003227
03:24:02.060 --> 03:24:05.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Five kilometers lang po ito.

asr-003228
03:24:05.060 --> 03:24:10.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kailangan na natin po ito.

asr-003229
03:24:10.060 --> 03:24:13.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pag na-interconnect natin ang major islands

asr-003230
03:24:13.060 --> 03:24:15.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: of Luzon,

asr-003231
03:24:15.060 --> 03:24:16.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Visayas,

asr-003232
03:24:16.060 --> 03:24:17.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: and Mindanao,

asr-003233
03:24:17.060 --> 03:24:18.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003234
03:24:18.060 --> 03:24:23.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang mga panaginip ng ating tao

asr-003235
03:24:23.060 --> 03:24:26.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ay binibigyan natin ng realisasyon.

asr-003236
03:24:26.060 --> 03:24:27.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: And,

asr-003237
03:24:27.060 --> 03:24:30.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: distance will no longer be,

asr-003238
03:24:30.060 --> 03:24:33.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: will no longer determine

asr-003239
03:24:33.060 --> 03:24:36.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: the outcome of the progress

asr-003240
03:24:36.060 --> 03:24:40.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: of each and every major island of our country.

asr-003241
03:24:40.060 --> 03:24:43.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maigiging irrelevant ang distansya

asr-003242
03:24:43.060 --> 03:24:46.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at pag nagawa po natin ito,

asr-003243
03:24:46.060 --> 03:24:47.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003244
03:24:47.060 --> 03:24:50.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na pwede nating gawin ngayon

asr-003245
03:24:50.060 --> 03:24:53.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na may liderato tayo ng DPWH

asr-003246
03:24:53.060 --> 03:24:56.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na noon pa ay bilib na ako.

asr-003247
03:24:56.060 --> 03:24:58.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At pag nagawa po natin ito,

asr-003248
03:24:58.060 --> 03:25:01.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: nandyan na ang basic foundations.

asr-003249
03:25:01.060 --> 03:25:04.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: We will bring our people

asr-003250
03:25:04.060 --> 03:25:07.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: faster to their destination.

asr-003251
03:25:07.060 --> 03:25:09.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: We can bring our patients

asr-003252
03:25:09.060 --> 03:25:12.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: faster to the medical hospitals.

asr-003253
03:25:12.060 --> 03:25:15.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: And we will bring our families

asr-003254
03:25:15.060 --> 03:25:16.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: closer together.

asr-003255
03:25:16.060 --> 03:25:18.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pag nagawa po natin ito.

asr-003256
03:25:18.060 --> 03:25:19.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kaya,

asr-003257
03:25:19.060 --> 03:25:20.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003258
03:25:20.060 --> 03:25:22.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: pwede bang ilagay ito sa susunod

asr-003259
03:25:22.060 --> 03:25:25.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: yung iba pang major bridges

asr-003260
03:25:25.060 --> 03:25:27.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na sinabi nyo nung po naman

asr-003261
03:25:27.060 --> 03:25:30.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na gusto ng mga funders

asr-003262
03:25:30.060 --> 03:25:32.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: lagyan ng pondo

asr-003263
03:25:32.060 --> 03:25:37.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang mga matataas na economic rate of returns

asr-003264
03:25:37.060 --> 03:25:41.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na ating major roads and bridges?

asr-003265
03:25:41.060 --> 03:25:42.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Tama po.

asr-003266
03:25:42.060 --> 03:25:44.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In fact, ang

asr-003267
03:25:44.060 --> 03:25:46.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Lady Bohol,

asr-003268
03:25:46.060 --> 03:25:47.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Bohol, Cebu,

asr-003269
03:25:47.060 --> 03:25:49.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Cebu, Santander

asr-003270
03:25:49.060 --> 03:25:52.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: ay kasama na sa mga bridges

asr-003271
03:25:52.060 --> 03:25:54.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: na pinag-aralan nilang isama

asr-003272
03:25:54.060 --> 03:25:56.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: sa mga priorities nila.

asr-003273
03:25:56.060 --> 03:25:58.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003274
03:25:58.060 --> 03:26:00.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: alam ko po na pinag-aralan na nila yan.

asr-003275
03:26:00.060 --> 03:26:02.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ang importante po

asr-003276
03:26:02.060 --> 03:26:06.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ay malagyan na natin ng bahay sa budget

asr-003277
03:26:06.060 --> 03:26:08.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: para magsimula na ang tuloy-tuloy

asr-003278
03:26:08.060 --> 03:26:10.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na paggawa ng mga tulay na ito.

asr-003279
03:26:10.060 --> 03:26:12.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: We are an archipelago,

asr-003280
03:26:12.060 --> 03:26:15.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: but we can connect our islands.

asr-003281
03:26:15.060 --> 03:26:21.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Moderno na ang engineering at construction ngayon.

asr-003282
03:26:21.060 --> 03:26:23.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Gawin na po natin ito.

asr-003283
03:26:23.060 --> 03:26:25.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Hindi lang tayo umaatras.

asr-003284
03:26:25.060 --> 03:26:28.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Hindi lang tayo tumitingin sa mga lilit na mga bagay.

asr-003285
03:26:28.060 --> 03:26:32.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Gawin natin ang nararapat na kaya naman natin.

asr-003286
03:26:32.060 --> 03:26:37.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 641.61 billion ang nakalaan sa ating pondo.

asr-003287
03:26:37.060 --> 03:26:39.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kunti lang ito.

asr-003288
03:26:39.060 --> 03:26:41.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: 1.1 billion.

asr-003289
03:26:41.060 --> 03:26:44.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Para sa feasibility study,

asr-003290
03:26:44.060 --> 03:26:46.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: para mabuo itong mga tuloy na ito,

asr-003291
03:26:46.060 --> 03:26:48.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: mag-connecta,

asr-003292
03:26:48.060 --> 03:26:51.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: magdikit-dikit ang ating mga tao

asr-003293
03:26:51.060 --> 03:26:54.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at umunlad ang ating bansa ng tama.

asr-003294
03:26:54.060 --> 03:26:58.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Nasa kamay niyo po yan sa DPWH.

asr-003295
03:26:58.060 --> 03:27:00.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Ginigising ko lang po

asr-003296
03:27:00.060 --> 03:27:02.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at binibigyan ko kayo

asr-003297
03:27:02.060 --> 03:27:06.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ng pagsaludo dahil gusto niyong mangyari ito.

asr-003298
03:27:06.060 --> 03:27:09.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At sana sa darating na mga taon,

asr-003299
03:27:09.060 --> 03:27:11.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: mabigyan natin itong kahulugan.

asr-003300
03:27:11.060 --> 03:27:13.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Dahil,

asr-003301
03:27:13.060 --> 03:27:15.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003302
03:27:15.060 --> 03:27:18.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: habang may bosis pa tayo,

asr-003303
03:27:18.060 --> 03:27:21.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: tatayo nang tatayo ko ako dito.

asr-003304
03:27:21.060 --> 03:27:28.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At magsasangayon naman tayo sa ating good sponsor, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003305
03:27:28.060 --> 03:27:32.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Dahil alam ko ang sponsor ay napakagaling din

asr-003306
03:27:32.060 --> 03:27:38.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at developmentally minded leader of Surgao del Sur.

asr-003307
03:27:39.060 --> 03:27:41.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003308
03:27:41.060 --> 03:27:44.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, good sponsor.

asr-003309
03:27:44.060 --> 03:27:48.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Your Honor. Thank you.

asr-003310
03:27:48.060 --> 03:27:51.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: And, Mr. Speaker,

asr-003311
03:27:51.060 --> 03:27:54.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: there being no interpolator

asr-003312
03:27:54.060 --> 03:27:56.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: on the side of the minority,

asr-003313
03:27:56.060 --> 03:27:59.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: I move that we terminate

asr-003314
03:27:59.060 --> 03:28:02.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: the period for interpolation and debate

asr-003315
03:28:02.060 --> 03:28:07.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: of the budget of the Department of Public Works and Highways.

asr-003316
03:28:07.060 --> 03:28:08.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003317
03:28:09.060 --> 03:28:12.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Before I continue, may I say

asr-003318
03:28:12.060 --> 03:28:15.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: the Minority Leader with a vision.

asr-003319
03:28:15.060 --> 03:28:18.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Naghang kayong salamat, Minority Leader.

asr-003320
03:28:18.060 --> 03:28:22.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Hopefully 2035-37 is in the horizon.

asr-003321
03:28:22.060 --> 03:28:25.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: What does the House say, Majority Leader?

asr-003322
03:28:25.060 --> 03:28:28.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Mr. Speaker, on the part of the majority,

asr-003323
03:28:28.060 --> 03:28:32.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we join the minority in the motion to terminate

asr-003324
03:28:32.060 --> 03:28:36.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: the period of interpolation on the proposed budget

asr-003325
03:28:36.060 --> 03:28:38.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: of the Department of Public Works and Highways.

asr-003326
03:28:39.060 --> 03:28:42.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So move, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003327
03:28:42.060 --> 03:28:44.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-003328
03:28:44.060 --> 03:28:45.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Naghang salamat.

asr-003329
03:28:45.060 --> 03:28:48.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: There is a joint motion to terminate

asr-003330
03:28:48.060 --> 03:28:51.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: the interpolations on the proposed budget

asr-003331
03:28:51.060 --> 03:28:54.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: of the Department of Public Works and Highways

asr-003332
03:28:54.060 --> 03:28:57.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: and its agencies and corporations.

asr-003333
03:28:57.060 --> 03:28:59.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Is there any objection?

asr-003334
03:28:59.060 --> 03:29:01.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The Chair hears none.

asr-003335
03:29:01.060 --> 03:29:04.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The interpolations on the proposed budget

asr-003336
03:29:04.060 --> 03:29:07.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: of the Department of Public Works and Highways

asr-003337
03:29:07.060 --> 03:29:12.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: and its agencies and corporations is hereby terminated.

asr-003338
03:29:16.060 --> 03:29:18.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Congratulations.

asr-003339
03:29:22.060 --> 03:29:25.060
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, move to suspend session for a few minutes.

asr-003340
03:29:25.060 --> 03:29:27.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Session suspended.

asr-003363
03:32:43.280 --> 03:32:52.000
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Ah, okay natin, ah, go. Session resumed. Majority Leader, please.

