asr-003391
03:35:08.460 --> 03:35:12.100
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: On behalf of Speaker Faustino Bojadida III,

asr-003392
03:35:12.720 --> 03:35:15.040
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: welcome to the House of Representatives.

asr-003393
03:35:15.760 --> 03:35:16.260
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Majority Leader.

asr-003394
03:35:17.000 --> 03:35:22.980
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Vice Chairman of Appropriations,

asr-003395
03:35:23.100 --> 03:35:24.260
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Charisse Ann Hernandez,

asr-003396
03:35:24.260 --> 03:35:28.940
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: of the Committee of Appropriations to sponsor the proposed budget

asr-003397
03:35:28.940 --> 03:35:31.040
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: of the Department of Trade and Industry,

asr-003398
03:35:31.780 --> 03:35:35.760
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: To the Vice Chair of the Lone District of Calamba City,

asr-003399
03:35:36.400 --> 03:35:38.140
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Charisse Anne C. Hernandez.

asr-003400
03:35:38.800 --> 03:35:40.900
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: You are recognized, ma'am. Please proceed.

asr-003401
03:35:45.600 --> 03:35:47.760
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you, Mr. Speaker,

asr-003402
03:35:48.920 --> 03:35:52.160
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and our distinguished colleagues that are still present here.

asr-003403
03:35:52.280 --> 03:35:56.200
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: I rise to sponsor the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget

asr-003404
03:35:56.200 --> 03:35:58.880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: of the Department of Trade and Industry.

asr-003405
03:35:58.880 --> 03:35:59.800
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Together,

asr-003406
03:35:59.980 --> 03:36:04.300
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: with its attached agencies and corporations,

asr-003407
03:36:04.300 --> 03:36:10.860
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: in the total amount of 10.903 billion pesos.

asr-003408
03:36:10.860 --> 03:36:14.860
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: In this time of economic uncertainty,

asr-003409
03:36:14.860 --> 03:36:18.100
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: we are asking the DTI to do more with less.

asr-003410
03:36:18.100 --> 03:36:22.000
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: So, permit me to state plainly what the more has been.

asr-003411
03:36:22.000 --> 03:36:24.040
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: In the first half of this year alone,

asr-003412
03:36:24.040 --> 03:36:29.940
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: the Department delivered 59.5 billion U.S. dollars in exports.

asr-003413
03:36:29.980 --> 03:36:37.020
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: It brought in 461.85 billion pesos in BOI-approved investments

asr-003414
03:36:37.020 --> 03:36:40.620
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and 140.68 billion through PESA.

asr-003415
03:36:41.160 --> 03:36:46.200
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Together, 37,000 projected Filipino jobs.

asr-003416
03:36:46.820 --> 03:36:50.920
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: It has stood up 1,454 negosyo centers.

asr-003417
03:36:51.780 --> 03:36:53.080
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And through the SB Corporation,

asr-003418
03:36:53.080 --> 03:36:57.940
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: it released 5.76 billion pesos in loans

asr-003419
03:36:57.940 --> 03:36:59.080
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: to 10,170

asr-003420
03:36:59.980 --> 03:37:05.100
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: MSMEs and conduits in half-year.

asr-003421
03:37:05.900 --> 03:37:13.860
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Its shared service facilities have generated 435,982 jobs

asr-003422
03:37:13.860 --> 03:37:17.240
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and reached over 841,000 beneficiaries.

asr-003423
03:37:17.500 --> 03:37:18.220
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: On the trade front,

asr-003424
03:37:18.800 --> 03:37:20.160
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: three agreements ratified,

asr-003425
03:37:20.440 --> 03:37:21.400
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: seven signed,

asr-003426
03:37:21.540 --> 03:37:24.440
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and two concluded under this administration

asr-003427
03:37:24.440 --> 03:37:27.940
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: with the ASEAN Digital Economy Framework Agreement

asr-003428
03:37:27.940 --> 03:37:29.360
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: for signing in November.

asr-003429
03:37:29.980 --> 03:37:33.380
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: The Philippines-Chile CEPA concluded

asr-003430
03:37:33.380 --> 03:37:37.820
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and the Philippines-European Union FTA within reach.

asr-003431
03:37:39.560 --> 03:37:40.820
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And on consumer protection,

asr-003432
03:37:41.220 --> 03:37:44.540
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: 14,424 firms monitored,

asr-003433
03:37:45.400 --> 03:37:49.680
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: 5,025 establishments checked for price and supply,

asr-003434
03:37:49.680 --> 03:37:53.500
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and 512 Philippine national standards promulgated.

asr-003435
03:37:53.660 --> 03:37:56.720
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker, these are not aspirations.

asr-003436
03:37:57.660 --> 03:37:59.220
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: These are receipt.

asr-003437
03:37:59.980 --> 03:38:02.700
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker, the common thread is this.

asr-003438
03:38:02.780 --> 03:38:04.800
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Ang bawat pisong pupondohan natin

asr-003439
03:38:04.800 --> 03:38:08.660
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: ay magiging bahagi po ng kwento ng isang Pilipino,

asr-003440
03:38:08.780 --> 03:38:10.140
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: ang isang export business

asr-003441
03:38:10.140 --> 03:38:14.120
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: na sinasara niya ang kanyang unang international order,

asr-003442
03:38:14.260 --> 03:38:15.940
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: ang isang sari-sari store owner

asr-003443
03:38:15.940 --> 03:38:18.920
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: na magkakaroon ng puhunan sa negosyo

asr-003444
03:38:18.920 --> 03:38:22.020
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: at ang karaniwang Pilipino na namamalingke

asr-003445
03:38:22.020 --> 03:38:25.540
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: na makakasiguradong ligtas at bago

asr-003446
03:38:25.540 --> 03:38:27.520
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: ang nabibili niyang mga produkto.

asr-003447
03:38:27.940 --> 03:38:28.960
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: At ito ay mura din,

asr-003448
03:38:29.100 --> 03:38:29.880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: at ito ay abot.

asr-003449
03:38:29.980 --> 03:38:30.240
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Kaya.

asr-003450
03:38:30.940 --> 03:38:32.940
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Additional accomplishments may be mentioned,

asr-003451
03:38:33.120 --> 03:38:38.220
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: but I'm looking forward to mention it later.

asr-003452
03:38:38.460 --> 03:38:41.760
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: So we are welcoming these questions

asr-003453
03:38:41.760 --> 03:38:43.380
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and these discussions on the floor.

asr-003454
03:38:43.740 --> 03:38:45.140
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: But may I just add, Mr. Speaker,

asr-003455
03:38:45.140 --> 03:38:48.400
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: that a properly funded DTI has the power

asr-003456
03:38:48.400 --> 03:38:51.860
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: to turn simple dreams into realities

asr-003457
03:38:51.860 --> 03:38:53.640
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: for ordinary Filipinos.

asr-003458
03:38:53.760 --> 03:38:57.480
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: So we have the power to convert the people's industry

asr-003459
03:38:57.480 --> 03:38:58.880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: into their prosperity.

asr-003460
03:38:58.880 --> 03:39:01.760
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: I therefore respectfully urge my colleagues

asr-003461
03:39:01.760 --> 03:39:04.520
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: to consider the restoration and augmentation

asr-003462
03:39:04.520 --> 03:39:07.220
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: na mamayarin po i-request natin.

asr-003463
03:39:07.380 --> 03:39:08.580
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Again, Mr. Speaker, thank you.

asr-003464
03:39:08.640 --> 03:39:10.240
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And I open the floor to questions.

asr-003465
03:39:11.440 --> 03:39:13.000
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Madam Sponsor,

asr-003466
03:39:13.100 --> 03:39:14.900
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Vice Chair Charisse Anne C. Hernandez.

asr-003467
03:39:15.500 --> 03:39:16.580
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Majority Leader, please.

asr-003468
03:39:17.640 --> 03:39:18.420
Rep. Sittie Shahara "Bai Dimple" I. Mastura: Mr. Speaker,

asr-003469
03:39:18.900 --> 03:39:19.880
Rep. Sittie Shahara "Bai Dimple" I. Mastura: I move that we recognize

asr-003470
03:39:20.520 --> 03:39:23.320
Rep. Sittie Shahara "Bai Dimple" I. Mastura: the Honorable Representative Sarah Jane Elago

asr-003471
03:39:23.320 --> 03:39:25.560
Rep. Sittie Shahara "Bai Dimple" I. Mastura: of Gabriela Women's Party List

asr-003472
03:39:25.560 --> 03:39:27.960
Rep. Sittie Shahara "Bai Dimple" I. Mastura: to interpolate on the proposed budget

asr-003473
03:39:27.960 --> 03:39:30.720
Rep. Sittie Shahara "Bai Dimple" I. Mastura: of the Department of Trade and Industry.

asr-003474
03:39:31.180 --> 03:39:33.420
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Gabriela Women's Party List.

asr-003475
03:39:33.900 --> 03:39:37.040
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Representative Sarah Jane I. Elago.

asr-003476
03:39:37.560 --> 03:39:38.600
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: You have the floor, ma'am.

asr-003477
03:39:39.260 --> 03:39:40.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Please proceed.

asr-003478
03:39:41.760 --> 03:39:43.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003479
03:39:43.640 --> 03:39:46.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang Pilipinas ay nasa ilalim pa rin

asr-003480
03:39:46.220 --> 03:39:48.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng State of National Energy Emergency.

asr-003481
03:39:49.020 --> 03:39:50.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa katunayan, ngayong buwan ng Setiembre,

asr-003482
03:39:51.620 --> 03:39:53.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagkaroon ang Pilipinas

asr-003483
03:39:53.100 --> 03:39:55.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng tatlong magkakasunod na oil price hike.

asr-003484
03:39:56.140 --> 03:39:57.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Umabot na sa 104 pesos.

asr-003485
03:39:57.960 --> 03:39:59.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, kada litro ang diesel.

asr-003486
03:40:00.240 --> 03:40:03.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang gasolina naman, nasa 87 pesos na per kilo.

asr-003487
03:40:04.180 --> 03:40:05.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At meron pang mga inaasahan

asr-003488
03:40:05.860 --> 03:40:08.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pagtataas sa mga susunod na linggo.

asr-003489
03:40:08.880 --> 03:40:09.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: You know, Speaker,

asr-003490
03:40:10.040 --> 03:40:12.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang DTI bilang chair

asr-003491
03:40:12.440 --> 03:40:14.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng National Price Coordinating Council,

asr-003492
03:40:15.300 --> 03:40:17.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mayroon po ba tayong agarang aksyon?

asr-003493
03:40:18.000 --> 03:40:19.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mayroon po bang pag-uusap?

asr-003494
03:40:20.000 --> 03:40:23.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hinggil sa kung paano natin matutulungan

asr-003495
03:40:23.400 --> 03:40:25.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang ating mga kababayan

asr-003496
03:40:25.040 --> 03:40:27.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na maibsan ang epekto

asr-003497
03:40:27.420 --> 03:40:29.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng pagtataas ng presyo ng lanis

asr-003498
03:40:29.700 --> 03:40:31.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na lubos po ang epekto rin

asr-003499
03:40:31.520 --> 03:40:35.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa presyo ng mga batayang bilihin sa ating bansa.

asr-003500
03:40:36.000 --> 03:40:38.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po ba tayong makahingi ng ulat

asr-003501
03:40:38.440 --> 03:40:40.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula sa ating distinguished sponsor

asr-003502
03:40:40.320 --> 03:40:42.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa DTI family

asr-003503
03:40:42.040 --> 03:40:44.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol sa napakahalaga na usapin na ito?

asr-003504
03:40:46.800 --> 03:40:48.900
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you, Mr. Speaker,

asr-003505
03:40:49.100 --> 03:40:50.340
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: distinguished colleague.

asr-003506
03:40:51.360 --> 03:40:54.400
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: At maraming salamat for pointing this out.

asr-003507
03:40:54.660 --> 03:40:55.860
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: It's very valid.

asr-003508
03:40:56.240 --> 03:40:57.380
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And sumusimula, syempre,

asr-003509
03:40:57.380 --> 03:40:58.660
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: nung Marso at April,

asr-003510
03:40:59.300 --> 03:41:00.920
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: lahat po tayo nag-aalala

asr-003511
03:41:00.920 --> 03:41:03.920
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: at lahat po ay lubhang

asr-003512
03:41:03.920 --> 03:41:06.520
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: nabahala sa mga pangyayari.

asr-003513
03:41:07.220 --> 03:41:10.000
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And when I was able to talk

asr-003514
03:41:10.000 --> 03:41:12.080
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: with the office of DTI

asr-003515
03:41:12.080 --> 03:41:15.080
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: and under the office of secretary

asr-003516
03:41:15.080 --> 03:41:16.840
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: of the Fair Trade Group,

asr-003517
03:41:17.000 --> 03:41:18.760
