Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pa tayo kasali sa Pax Silica.

asr-004331
04:17:50.560 --> 04:17:52.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Parang may mga initial commitments na.

asr-004332
04:17:52.340 --> 04:17:58.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos kahit itong offer ni BCDA through President Bingkang,

asr-004333
