Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: may mga initial talks.

asr-004339
04:18:22.340 --> 04:18:30.340
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Ngunit nung panahon po na yun ay wala pa pong official or formal transmittal document.

asr-004340
