Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magkano ba yung 2027?

asr-005648
05:07:38.220 --> 05:07:45.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Negative pa nga eh. Negative 45.4% yung MOOE.

asr-005649
05:07:46.660 --> 05:07:56.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, parang indirectly, you are telling CDA na,

asr-005650
05:07:56.180 --> 05:07:57.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: umalis na nga kayo sa tahanan namin?

asr-005651
05:07:58.940 --> 05:08:02.040
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues, may I respond?

asr-005652
05:08:02.300 --> 05:08:03.380
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Hindi po.

asr-005653
05:08:04.740 --> 05:08:07.740
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Nung kasama po ang buong proposal,

asr-005654
05:08:08.480 --> 05:08:12.760
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: hindi po ang ahensya ng DTI ang nang-zero dito.

asr-005655
05:08:16.500 --> 05:08:22.240
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Meron pong kaakibat na pondo po, mayroong nirequest po para dito,

asr-005656
05:08:22.520 --> 05:08:25.460
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: pero hindi po DTI ang naglagay ng zero.

asr-005657
05:08:25.460 --> 05:08:28.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kandi, Distinguished Sponsor, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005658
05:08:29.520 --> 05:08:34.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: labi, magkaibigan naman kayo ng chairperson sa APRO.

asr-005659
05:08:35.040 --> 05:08:41.540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya nga, ikaw yung pinili na mag-sponsor sa budget ng DTI kasama si CDA.

asr-005660
05:08:42.040 --> 05:08:49.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kandi, Distinguished Sponsor, commit na may labi man lang kahit may maidagdag na 1 piso dito sa CDA.

asr-005661
05:08:49.900 --> 05:08:51.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bahala na kayo sa 1 piso.

asr-005662
05:08:51.340 --> 05:08:55.080
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues, ang inyo pong lingkod,

asr-005663
05:08:55.080 --> 05:08:56.660
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: will definitely lobby.

asr-005664
05:08:57.260 --> 05:09:04.800
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And ito po, specifically, coming from the data or sa request po nabigay po ng CDA,

asr-005665
05:09:04.940 --> 05:09:10.560
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: there's actually seeking, just for the record, an additional of 846 million

asr-005666
05:09:10.560 --> 05:09:17.520
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: para po sa enterprise development, market enhancement, regional office buildings in 7 regions.

asr-005667
05:09:18.320 --> 05:09:24.900
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: At talaga pong kasama po ang CDA at DTI, collective effort talaga para po magkaroon ng

asr-005668
05:09:24.900 --> 05:09:29.560
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: mas inclusive development sa lahat, sa buong bansa po.

asr-005669
05:09:29.700 --> 05:09:36.640
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And definitely, we will fight for the budget of CDA na mapondohan po ito.

asr-005670
05:09:36.780 --> 05:09:45.580
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Kaya maraming salamat din po sa pagtayo po dito at sa pag-raise po ng concern na ito, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues.

asr-005671
05:09:45.860 --> 05:09:48.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Distinguished Sponsor, taga-electric cooperative po ako.

asr-005672
05:09:49.160 --> 05:09:52.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pareho po, cooperative ang apelido namin. Magkapatid po kami.

asr-005673
05:09:53.740 --> 05:09:54.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So...

asr-005674
05:09:54.340 --> 05:09:55.200
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Yes po.

asr-005675
05:09:56.520 --> 05:10:03.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Lahat ng team, mga kamag-anak po namin yan.

asr-005676
05:10:03.800 --> 05:10:13.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Finally, dito sa CDA issue, papano po yung ating RISE, yung Recovery Innovation, Sustainability and Empowerment program natin,

asr-005677
05:10:14.820 --> 05:10:16.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mayroon po bang pondo para dito?

asr-005678
05:10:19.480 --> 05:10:24.240
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleagues, dun po sa cooperative,

asr-005679
05:10:24.340 --> 05:10:25.340
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: RISE,

asr-005680
05:10:26.340 --> 05:10:31.380
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: we are also requesting, kasama na po ito, diba po?

asr-005681
05:10:31.540 --> 05:10:47.760
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Kasama na po para po sa recovery, innovation, sustainability and empowerment na magkaroon o mabalik o magkapondo po ng 120 million,

asr-005682
05:10:47.760 --> 05:10:54.260
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: that this fund will make sure, that this fund kasi po will definitely,

asr-005683
05:10:54.340 --> 05:11:00.300
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: may benefit cooperatives, like yung sinabi po ninyo na kooperatiba.

asr-005684
05:11:00.720 --> 05:11:09.120
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: May proposed request po tayo na 120 million para po sa RISE, cooperative RISE.

asr-005685
05:11:09.860 --> 05:11:11.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-005686
05:11:11.500 --> 05:11:23.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Finally, on the issue of CDA, mga pangakailangan ng CDA, this representation would like to manifest that I,

asr-005687
05:11:24.340 --> 05:11:38.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: personally, I am personally supporting the additional funding of CDA in terms of the construction of your regional offices,

asr-005688
05:11:38.080 --> 05:11:47.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: cooperative development, cooperative enterprise development, yung mga market enhancement program natin,

asr-005689
05:11:48.500 --> 05:11:53.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: more or less 150 million din yung sa...

asr-005690
05:11:54.340 --> 05:12:03.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: RISE na 120 million, nandito naman siguro yung taga DBM dahil normally naman may representative dito sa DBM,

asr-005691
05:12:03.840 --> 05:12:08.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nagtatago nga lang dahil sila ang kumakalta sa mga budget.

asr-005692
05:12:08.760 --> 05:12:15.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana narinig ninyo kung nasa CR kayo o saan, taga DBM, may pangangailangan tayo.

asr-005693
05:12:15.360 --> 05:12:21.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, now to another issue, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-005694
05:12:22.560 --> 05:12:24.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nakikita ko, dito sa...

asr-005695
05:12:24.340 --> 05:12:31.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: budget utilization ratio ng DTI, it is declining, no?

asr-005696
05:12:32.280 --> 05:12:38.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: You have a declining overall budget utilization sa 20...

asr-005697
05:12:39.260 --> 05:12:46.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: from 91.3% sa 2023, nagiging 84.2% sa 2025.

asr-005698
05:12:46.720 --> 05:12:51.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Then, pababa pa siya ngayon at...

asr-005699
05:12:54.340 --> 05:12:57.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pababa pa siya ng 71% sa 2025.

asr-005700
05:12:58.080 --> 05:13:06.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mid-year 2026, approximately 5.8 billion of released allotments remain unobligated.

asr-005701
05:13:07.760 --> 05:13:13.540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, I believe that the issue is not merely whether appropriations were released.

asr-005702
05:13:13.540 --> 05:13:23.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: There appears to be a widening gap between the budget, authority, obligation, actual payment, and delivery of program.

asr-005703
05:13:23.220 --> 05:13:23.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So,

asr-005704
05:13:24.340 --> 05:13:29.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: papano po nangyari itong may ginagawa na ba tayo to resolve this issue?

asr-005705
05:13:30.880 --> 05:13:32.240
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker,

asr-005706
05:13:32.720 --> 05:13:35.480
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Distinguished Colleagues,

asr-005707
05:13:36.580 --> 05:13:43.320
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: maihabol ko lang po, Mr. Speaker, na yung budget nga po natin ngayon for 2027 is 11% smaller.

asr-005708
05:13:43.320 --> 05:13:52.140
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mahabol ko lang po yun, kaya siguro isa po yun sa naapektuhan po ang cooperatives now with the utilization.

asr-005709
05:13:52.140 --> 05:14:01.500
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: And just to settle din po yung issue about the utilization ng funding.

asr-005710
05:14:01.500 --> 05:14:02.500
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Wait.

asr-005711
05:14:02.500 --> 05:14:19.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang hindi ko maintindihan, Mr. Speaker, parang DTI budget talaga to may problema sa utilization.

asr-005712
05:14:19.360 --> 05:14:22.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit si CDE ang nabawasan?

asr-005713
05:14:22.140 --> 05:14:28.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit kung si Juan ang may problema, si Pedro ang kinastigo?

asr-005714
05:14:29.020 --> 05:14:31.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yan po yung hindi ko maintindihan.

asr-005715
05:14:31.220 --> 05:14:43.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos, napapansin ko po na yung pinakamalaking bahagi ng inyong budget ay concentrated doon sa Office of the Secretary.

asr-005716
05:14:44.460 --> 05:14:52.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit po parang 76% yata ay nakalagak sa Office of the Secretary?

asr-005719
05:14:54.820 --> 05:14:59.700
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, hindi po.

asr-005720
05:15:00.000 --> 05:15:15.840
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Ah, okay. Yung budget po na sinasabi sa Office of the Secretary ay hindi po ito, as a whole of DTI po ito, Mr. Speaker, distinguished speaker.

asr-005721
05:15:15.840 --> 05:15:34.580
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: So, naman po sa question or concern about the utilization, nagkaroon po ng delay sa fund utilization at masabi po natin dahil din sa late approval ng mga bidding, ng mga documentary requirements po.

asr-005722
05:15:34.580 --> 05:15:43.680
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: At may mga so on and so forth. We can also give it to you specifically. We have the data here po, Mr. Speaker. May mga delays po.

asr-005723
05:15:44.820 --> 05:15:45.580
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Of course, muli.

asr-005724
05:15:45.840 --> 05:15:49.780
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mula po sa ahensya kung saan nag-approve po natin ito.

asr-005725
05:15:49.780 --> 05:16:15.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Anyway, distinguished sponsor, salamat doon sa kasagutan. Ang huli ko na lang hiling sa DTI, isubmit nyo na yung hiningi ko na dita regarding doon sa cost of products, yung percentage cost of electricity in our

asr-005726
05:16:15.840 --> 05:16:45.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: cost of production. So, ang ibig kong sabihin, halimbawa, yung isang produkto na ito, magkano ba yung percentage cost ng electricity? Matagal ko na pong hiningi yan. Wala pa pong nagbigay kasi kailangan namin yan sa Committee on Energy para matantya natin gaano kalaki ang epekto ng pagtaas ng cost ng korinti.

asr-005727
05:16:45.840 --> 05:17:05.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon sa cost of products and services. So, kahit, ano, ibigay nyo bago magtapos yung termino ko sa 2028, basta ibigay nyo. Anyway, magamit pa naman yan sa susunod. Pero, kung talagang nagtatrabaho kayo sa trabaho ninyo, mayroon kayo yan. Can you commit, distinguished sponsor?

asr-005728
05:17:06.740 --> 05:17:13.300
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Mr. Speaker, distinguished release, yes, we can commit and we will submit. And rest assured that the DTI is doing the best it can.

asr-005729
05:17:13.300 --> 05:17:15.040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Para po sa ating lahat yan. Kasi,

asr-005730
05:17:15.200 --> 05:17:15.520
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Yes.

asr-005731
05:17:15.840 --> 05:17:41.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung budget ng DPWH napakalaki. Ilang tuninadang siminto ang kailangan natin at bakal. Kung matantya natin, yung paggawaan yan, magkano yung cost ng korinti, paggawaan ng mga yan, baka mapamura natin ng kunti, madami pa tayong project na magawa. I hope na intindihan ninyo kung saan ang galing yung hugot ko. Kasi gusto ko talaga maipababa dahil malaking tolong sa atin.

asr-005732
05:17:41.120 --> 05:17:44.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, Mr. Speaker,

asr-005733
05:17:44.060 --> 05:18:14.040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Considering na hindi man lang nila masagot kahit magtanong pa ako, hindi ko nadagdagan yung tanong ko, and since there will be no other members from the minority who is to interpellate, kasi natulog na, I move to terminate the period of interpellation and debate on the proposed budget of the Department of Trade and Industry and its attached agency.

asr-005734
05:18:14.060 --> 05:18:17.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: For the fiscal year 2027.

asr-005735
05:18:17.740 --> 05:18:19.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005736
