asr-005742
05:18:44.060 --> 05:18:48.720
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Of the Department of Trade and Industry and its attached agencies and corporations.

asr-005743
05:18:49.540 --> 05:18:51.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Is there any objection?

asr-005744
05:18:51.980 --> 05:18:53.180
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The Chair hears none.

asr-005745
05:18:53.180 --> 05:19:03.540
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The interpellations on the proposed budget of the Department of Trade and Industry, attached agencies and corporations is hereby terminated.

