Rep. Brian Poe: commitments to establish Philippine presence, strengthening government accountability and legal jurisdiction for the platforms.

asr-005813
05:27:48.060 --> 05:27:55.920
Rep. Brian Poe: Secretary Henry Aguda has assured me that DICT is actively studying international best practices

asr-005814
05:27:55.920 --> 05:28:05.620
